    [4107]={name="Tiger Hunter Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Tiger Mastery'.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Tiger Mastery",lore="Here is the final challenge that I will put forth. We've been tracking an elusive tiger for weeks."},
    [4108]={name="Panther Hunter Leggings",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Panther Mastery'. Starts with Sir S. J. Erlgadin in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Sir S. J. Erlgadin of Nesingwary's Expedition wants you to bring him the Fang of Bhag'thera.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Panther Mastery",lore="You've almost proven yourself to be a master hunter of panthers."},
    [4109]={name="Excelsior Boots",quality=2,ilvl=41,reqLevel=31,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Excelsior'. Starts with Drizzlik in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring an Elder Crocolisk Skin to Drizzlik in Booty Bay.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Excelsior",lore="For this, I use only the best elder croc skins. They are more durable and a better canvas--if you will--for adding the designs and accents that make Drizzlik's Excelsior line."},
    [4112]={name="Choker of the High Shaman",quality=2,ilvl=44,reqLevel=33,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Mok'thardin's Enchantment'. Starts with Far Seer Mok'thardin in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Far Seer Mok'thardin of Grom'gol needs Holy Spring Water. He also wants you to kill 10 Naga Explorers.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Mok'thardin's Enchantment",lore="There is but one final reagent needed to complete the enchantment. In the south, towards the western coast, high above the bluffs, lies a Holy Spring."},
    [4114]={name="Darktide Cape",quality=2,ilvl=42,reqLevel=37,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Keep An Eye Out'. Starts with Dizzy One-Eye in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Dizzy One-Eye in Booty Bay wants you to retrieve his eye from the Bloodsail Buccaneers.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Keep An Eye Out",lore="Avast! Who goes there? Argh, I am but useless without me special enchanted eye. Bad enough to have lost me eyes in battle in the first place!"},
    [4119]={name="Raptor Hunter Tunic",quality=2,ilvl=43,reqLevel=28,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Raptor Mastery'. Starts with Hemet Nesingwary in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Hemet Nesingwary wants you to kill Tethis, an elusive, dangerous raptor in Stranglethorn.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Raptor Mastery",lore="Because you proved yourself to be such a go-getter in the jungle, let me tell you about a ferocious raptor that even I have failed to kill."},
    [4120]={name="Robe of Crystal Waters",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=32,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Curse of the Tides'. Starts with Catelyn the Blade in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Destroy the Altar of the Tides with Catelyn's Blade, kill Gazban and bring the Stone of the Tides and Catelyn's Blade back to Baron Revilgaz.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="The Curse of the Tides",lore="So you're looking for an altar of some sort? Well, I'm no expert on troll ruins like my father, but I have heard about a sunken troll city out near that island you're looking for."},
    [4121]={name="Gemmed Gloves",quality=2,ilvl=35,reqLevel=31,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Hostile Takeover'. Starts with Kebok in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Retrieve 8 Tumbled Crystals and return them to Kebok in Booty Bay.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Hostile Takeover",lore="He's done it this time! Bad enough that Gelriz's muscling out the moguls who were appointed by the trade princes, now he tries to cut in on the most notorious pirate!"},
    [4123]={name="Frost Metal Pauldrons",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Report to Doren'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corporal Sethman in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Speak with Lieutenant Doren.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Report to Doren",lore="Did Lieutenant Doren want you to report back to him with that patrol information?"},
    [4124]={name="Cap of Harmony",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=32,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Return to Corporal Kaleb'. Starts with Krazek in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring Krazek's Fixed Pot to Corporal Kaleb at the Rebel Camp.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Return to Corporal Kaleb",lore="While you were gone I fixed the pot you brought me. I even added an extra steam whistle, and look! There's a new chopper at the bottom that'll cut through leg bones!"},
    [4126]={name="Guerrilla Cleaver",quality=2,ilvl=34,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bad Medicine'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sergeant Yohwa in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring 7 Jungle Remedies and 1 Venom Fern Extract to Sergeant Yohwa at the Rebel Camp.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Bad Medicine",lore="To have a chance against Kurzen, we need his healing support neutralized. He has gathered a large number of Medicine Men who heal his forces with Jungle Remedies and poison our fighters with Venom Fern Extracts."},
    [4127]={name="Shrapnel Blaster",quality=2,ilvl=40,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Colonel Kurzen'. Starts with Lieutenant Doren in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Kill 6 Kurzen Elite, 4 Kurzen Subchiefs, and bring Kurzen's Head to Lieutenant Doren at the Rebel Camp.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Colonel Kurzen",lore="You have proven yourself time and again, and your resourcefulness seems to rival even that of Kurzen himself. You may be the salvation of our band of rebels...if you can pit yourself against Kurzen and prevail!"},
    [4130]={name="Smotts' Compass",quality=2,ilvl=50,reqLevel=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Facing Negolash'. Objective: Bring 10 Barbecued Buzzard Wings and 5 bottles of Junglevine Wine to Captain Smotts' Lifeboat.Kill Negolash, and bring Smotts' Cutlass to Captain Smotts in Stranglethorn.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Facing Negolash",lore="Negolash is a hungry giant. When the giants destroyed our ship, Negolash went straight for my kitchen. He wasn't hungry for crew like the other giants."},
    [4131]={name="Belt of Corruption",quality=2,ilvl=44,reqLevel=35,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Zanzil's Secret'. Starts with Crank Fizzlebub in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring 12 samples of Zanzil's Mixture to Crank Fizzlebub in Booty Bay.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Zanzil's Secret",lore="Zanzil the Outcast dwells with his followers in the Jubuwal and Aboraz Ruins, northeast of Booty Bay. He is exiled from his tribe. Why? Well..."},
    [4133]={name="Darkspear Cuffs",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Headhunting'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Nimboya in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring 20 Shrunken Heads to Nimboya at the Grom'gol Base Camp.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Headhunting",lore="We must find if Yenniku is dead. Slay the Bloodscalp Headhunters and take from them their Shrunken Heads. You must gather many, many heads, and I will inspect them to make sure Yenniku's head is not among them."},
    [4134]={name="Nimboya's Mystical Staff",quality=2,ilvl=46,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Saving Yenniku'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Kin'weelay in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring the Filled Soul Gem to Nimboya.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Saving Yenniku",lore="I have reshaped the Mind's Eye into a Soul Gem. Its purpose is twofold: you must use it to stun Yenniku, and once stunned place it upon his head to entrap his soul."},
    [4139]={name="Junglewalker Sandals",quality=2,ilvl=37,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Report to Doren'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Corporal Sethman in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Speak with Lieutenant Doren.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Report to Doren",lore="Did Lieutenant Doren want you to report back to him with that patrol information?"},
    [4140]={name="Palm Frond Mantle",quality=2,ilvl=34,reqLevel=30,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Bad Medicine'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Sergeant Yohwa in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: Bring 7 Jungle Remedies and 1 Venom Fern Extract to Sergeant Yohwa at the Rebel Camp.",zone="Stranglethorn Vale",questName="Bad Medicine",lore="To have a chance against Kurzen, we need his healing support neutralized. He has gathered a large number of Medicine Men who heal his forces with Jungle Remedies and poison our fighters with Venom Fern Extracts."},
