    [13982]={name="Warblade of Caer Darrow",quality=3,ilvl=63,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Magistrate Marduke in Western Plaguelands. Objective: Find Ras Frostwhisper in the Scholomance. When you have found him, use the Soulbound Keepsake on his undead visage. Should you succeed in reverting him to a mortal, strike him down and recover the Human Head of Ras Frostwhisper. Take the head back to Magistrate Marduke.",zone="Scholomance",questName="The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper",lore="There is but one task remaining. Confront the lich, Ras Frostwhisper, in his lair. Use the power of the keepsake against the beast - be unrelenting in your actions!"},
