    [17743]={name="Resurgence Rod",quality=3,ilvl=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Corruption of Earth and Seed'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Selendra in Maraudon. Objective: Slay Princess Theradras and return to Selendra near Shadowprey Village in Desolace.",zone="Maraudon",questName="Corruption of Earth and Seed",lore="Deep in Maraudon lives an evil creature of chaos--Princess Theradras is an elemental force of earth related to the Old Gods. Ages ago, she and Zaetar, first son of Cenarius, began a relationship."},
    [17753]={name="Verdant Keeper's Aim",quality=3,ilvl=53,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Corruption of Earth and Seed'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Selendra in Maraudon. Objective: Slay Princess Theradras and return to Selendra near Shadowprey Village in Desolace.",zone="Maraudon",questName="Corruption of Earth and Seed",lore="Deep in Maraudon lives an evil creature of chaos--Princess Theradras is an elemental force of earth related to the Old Gods. Ages ago, she and Zaetar, first son of Cenarius, began a relationship.",proc="Equip: Chance to strike your ranged target with Keeper's Sting for 15 to 21 Nature damage."},
    [17775]={name="Acumen Robes",quality=2,ilvl=47,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Twisted Evils'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Willow in Desolace. Objective: Collect 25 Theradric Crystal Carvings for Willow in Desolace.",zone="Maraudon",questName="Twisted Evils",lore="The crystal caverns of Terramok lie to the west, deep within Maraudon... It is an ancient place with much history. And I am looking to get my hands on some of it."},
    [17776]={name="Sprightring Helm",quality=2,ilvl=49,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Twisted Evils'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Willow in Desolace. Objective: Collect 25 Theradric Crystal Carvings for Willow in Desolace.",zone="Maraudon",questName="Twisted Evils",lore="The crystal caverns of Terramok lie to the west, deep within Maraudon... It is an ancient place with much history. And I am looking to get my hands on some of it."},
    [17777]={name="Relentless Chain",quality=3,ilvl=47,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Twisted Evils'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Willow in Desolace. Objective: Collect 25 Theradric Crystal Carvings for Willow in Desolace.",zone="Maraudon",questName="Twisted Evils",lore="The crystal caverns of Terramok lie to the west, deep within Maraudon... It is an ancient place with much history. And I am looking to get my hands on some of it."},
    [17778]={name="Sagebrush Girdle",quality=2,ilvl=49,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Vyletongue Corruption'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Vark Battlescar in Maraudon. Objective: Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon.Use the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge.Heal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Vark Battlescar in Shadowprey Village.",zone="Maraudon",questName="Vyletongue Corruption",lore="A satyr known as Vyletongue has corrupted the caverns of Maraudon, stunting the growth of many of the plants inside. Take this vial."},
    [17903]={name="Stormpike Insignia Rank 5",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Legendary Heroes'. Starts with Lieutenant Haggerdin in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressBefore me stands an exalted hero of the Alliance.&lt;Lieutenant Haggerdin salutes.&gt;Few have earned such a rank among the Stormpike. I have watched the enemy fall before you. I have seen their resolve crumble in your presence. When you enter the fray, you become the beacon of hope for our forces!Present your insignia.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="Legendary Heroes",lore="Rise and be honored! Present your insignia.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Dun Baldar. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [17904]={name="Stormpike Insignia Rank 6",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Eye of Command'. Starts with Warmaster Laggrond in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressDrek'Thar sings your praises. Kalimdor is abuzz with tales of your heroics. The Warchief glows - your stalwart defense of our clan has pleased him greatly.You have earned the Eye of Command.Present your insignia, Commander &lt;name&gt;.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="The Eye of Command",lore="Your time has come again. You have earned a new ranking and as such, a new insignia denoting this rise in stature.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Dun Baldar."},
    [17908]={name="Frostwolf Insignia Rank 5",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Legendary Heroes'. Starts with Lieutenant Haggerdin in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressBefore me stands an exalted hero of the Alliance.&lt;Lieutenant Haggerdin salutes.&gt;Few have earned such a rank among the Stormpike. I have watched the enemy fall before you. I have seen their resolve crumble in your presence. When you enter the fray, you become the beacon of hope for our forces!Present your insignia.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="Legendary Heroes",lore="Your radiate command and power, shaman. Exalted in the eyes of Frostwolf - the enemy cowers at the mention of your name.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Frostwolf Keep. (2 Min Cooldown)"},
    [17909]={name="Frostwolf Insignia Rank 6",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Eye of Command'. Starts with Warmaster Laggrond in Alterac Mountains. Objective: ProgressDrek'Thar sings your praises. Kalimdor is abuzz with tales of your heroics. The Warchief glows - your stalwart defense of our clan has pleased him greatly.You have earned the Eye of Command.Present your insignia, Commander &lt;name&gt;.",zone="Alterac Valley",questName="The Eye of Command",lore="You have earned the Eye of Command. Present your insignia, Commander.",proc="Use: Returns you to the sanctuary of Frostwolf Keep."},
    [18083]={name="Jumanza Grips",quality=3,ilvl=47,reqLevel=42,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Witch Doctor Zum'rah.",zone="Zul'Farrak",npc="Witch Doctor Zum'rah"},
    [18205]={name="Eskhandar's Collar",quality=4,ilvl=71,reqLevel=60,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Onyxia.",zone="Onyxia's Lair",npc="Onyxia",lore="Deathwing's daughter and Nefarian's sister. She spent years in Stormwind as Lady Katrana Prestor, advising the throne she was working to undermine."},
    [18238]={name="Shadowskin Gloves",quality=3,ilvl=40,reqLevel=35,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Leatherworking (requires skill 1).",profession="Leatherworking"},
    [18282]={name="Core Marksman Rifle",quality=4,ilvl=65,reqLevel=60,sourceType="profession",instructions="Crafted with Engineering (requires skill 1).",profession="Engineering"},
    [18308]={name="Clever Hat",quality=2,ilvl=58,reqLevel=53,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Zevrim Thornhoof.",zone="Dire Maul",npc="Zevrim Thornhoof"},
    [18340]={name="Eidolon Talisman",quality=3,ilvl=59,reqLevel=54,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Eldreth Apparition.",zone="Dire Maul",npc="Eldreth Apparition"},
    [18344]={name="Stonebark Gauntlets",quality=3,ilvl=59,reqLevel=54,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Petrified Treant.",zone="Dire Maul",npc="Petrified Treant"},
    [18367]={name="Gordok's Gauntlets",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Unfinished Gordok Business'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul. Objective: Find the Gauntlet of Gordok Might and return it to Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul.According to Kromcrush, the \"old timey story\" says that Tortheldrin - a \"creepy\" elf who called himself a prince - stole it from one of the Gordok kings.",zone="Dire Maul",questName="Unfinished Gordok Business",lore="Now you da king, so maybe you get prized Gordok artifact back from creepy elf who calls himself Prince! Da king before you failed, just like all da other kings since Tortheldrin - da creepy elf - stole it from old timey Gordok king!"},
    [18368]={name="Gordok's Gloves",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Unfinished Gordok Business'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul. Objective: Find the Gauntlet of Gordok Might and return it to Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul.According to Kromcrush, the \"old timey story\" says that Tortheldrin - a \"creepy\" elf who called himself a prince - stole it from one of the Gordok kings.",zone="Dire Maul",questName="Unfinished Gordok Business",lore="Now you da king, so maybe you get prized Gordok artifact back from creepy elf who calls himself Prince! Da king before you failed, just like all da other kings since Tortheldrin - da creepy elf - stole it from old timey Gordok king!"},
    [18369]={name="Gordok's Handwraps",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Unfinished Gordok Business'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul. Objective: Find the Gauntlet of Gordok Might and return it to Captain Kromcrush in Dire Maul.According to Kromcrush, the \"old timey story\" says that Tortheldrin - a \"creepy\" elf who called himself a prince - stole it from one of the Gordok kings.",zone="Dire Maul",questName="Unfinished Gordok Business",lore="Now you da king, so maybe you get prized Gordok artifact back from creepy elf who calls himself Prince! Da king before you failed, just like all da other kings since Tortheldrin - da creepy elf - stole it from old timey Gordok king!"},
    [18387]={name="Brightspark Gloves",quality=3,ilvl=60,reqLevel=55,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Tsu'zee.",zone="Dire Maul",npc="Tsu'zee"},
    [18390]={name="Tanglemoss Leggings",quality=3,ilvl=61,reqLevel=57,sourceType="boss_drop",instructions="Drops from Tendris Warpwood.",zone="Dire Maul",npc="Tendris Warpwood"},
    [18399]={name="Ocean's Breeze",quality=3,ilvl=63,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'A Hero's Reward'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Duke Hydraxis in Azshara. Objective: Claim your reward from Hydraxis' Coffer.",zone="Azshara",questName="A Hero's Reward",lore="your services to the Warlords surpassed all we could expect from the denizens of this world. We do not understand your people's notions of gratitude, or rewarding good works, but in this case..."},
    [18400]={name="Ring of Living Stone",quality=2,ilvl=57,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Uncovering Past Secrets'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Umber in Moonglade. Objective: Speak with Rabine Saturna in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade.",zone="Moonglade",questName="Uncovering Past Secrets",lore="Anyway, you should check back with me relatively soon... that is if you want to know what was in here. As soon as I find out what it is, and if it's indeed a book, I'd be happy to share that information with you."},
    [18402]={name="Glowing Crystal Ring",quality=2,ilvl=57,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Uncovering Past Secrets'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Umber in Moonglade. Objective: Speak with Rabine Saturna in the village of Nighthaven, Moonglade.",zone="Moonglade",questName="Uncovering Past Secrets",lore="Anyway, you should check back with me relatively soon... that is if you want to know what was in here. As soon as I find out what it is, and if it's indeed a book, I'd be happy to share that information with you."},
    [18403]={name="Dragonslayer's Signet",quality=4,ilvl=74,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'For All To See'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="For All To See",lore="Overlord Runthak awaits your arrival in the Valley of Strength. Do not keep your public waiting, hero."},
    [18404]={name="Onyxia Tooth Pendant",quality=4,ilvl=74,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'For All To See'. Pick it over the other reward choices.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="For All To See",lore="One of Onyxia's own teeth, taken after she was finally dragged out of Stormwind's court and killed in her lair."},
    [18410]={name="Sprinter's Sword",quality=2,ilvl=57,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Feralas. Objective: Travel to Dire Maul and locate the Imp, Pusillin. Convince Pusillin to give you Azj'Tordin's Book of Incantations through any means necessary.Return to Azj'Tordin at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas should you recover the Book of Incantations.",zone="Dire Maul",questName="Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin",lore="I had let my guard down for only one moment, stranger. In my haste to escape the grip of the fallen Prince, I was robbed.",proc="Chance on hit: Increases run speed by 30% for 10 sec."},
    [18411]={name="Spry Boots",quality=2,ilvl=57,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin'. Pick it over the other reward choices. The quest is in Feralas. Objective: Travel to Dire Maul and locate the Imp, Pusillin. Convince Pusillin to give you Azj'Tordin's Book of Incantations through any means necessary.Return to Azj'Tordin at the Lariss Pavilion in Feralas should you recover the Book of Incantations.",zone="Dire Maul",questName="Pusillin and the Elder Azj'Tordin",lore="I had let my guard down for only one moment, stranger. In my haste to escape the grip of the fallen Prince, I was robbed."},
    [18424]={name="Sedge Boots",quality=3,ilvl=63,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Treasure of the Shen'dralar'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Shen'dralar Ancient in Dire Maul. Objective: Return to the Athenaeum and find the Treasure of the Shen'dralar. Claim your reward! A level 60 Dire Maul Quest (Dungeon). Rewards , , or . Always up to date.",zone="Dire Maul",questName="The Treasure of the Shen'dralar",lore="In the library, Athenaeum, you will find an ancient chest hidden beneath the stairway. Take from it that which you desire."},
