    [19619]={name="Maelstrom's Tendril",quality=3,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Maelstrom's Tendril'. Starts with Falthir the Sightless in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: ProgressAh, &lt;name&gt;, it is good to smell you again.You'll have to excuse my sense of humor. It can be most foul at times.I sense that you have caused great anguish to our enemies. The forces of Hakkar cry out your name in anger. This is most excellent.You have earned another weave on your talisman. Hand it to me.",zone="Zul'Gurub",questName="The Maelstrom's Tendril"},
    [19620]={name="Maelstrom's Tendril",quality=3,ilvl=68,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'The Maelstrom's Tendril'. Starts with Falthir the Sightless in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: ProgressAh, &lt;name&gt;, it is good to smell you again.You'll have to excuse my sense of humor. It can be most foul at times.I sense that you have caused great anguish to our enemies. The forces of Hakkar cry out your name in anger. This is most excellent.You have earned another weave on your talisman. Hand it to me.",zone="Zul'Gurub",questName="The Maelstrom's Tendril"},
    [19621]={name="Maelstrom's Wrath",quality=4,ilvl=65,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Maelstrom's Wrath'. Starts with Falthir the Sightless in Stranglethorn Vale. Objective: ProgressMolthor delivers word from King Rastakhan, &lt;name&gt;. The royal court is most impressed with your decimation of the Hakkari forces. I am to award you with the final weave in your talisman. Hand it to me.",zone="Zul'Gurub",questName="Maelstrom's Wrath"},
