    [22440]={name="Cryptstalker Boots",quality=4,ilvl=86,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cryptstalker Boots'. Starts with Huntsman Leopold in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Boots if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Boots, 12 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Cryptstalker Boots",lore="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas."},
    [22441]={name="Cryptstalker Handguards",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cryptstalker Handguards'. Starts with Huntsman Leopold in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Handguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Handguards, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 5 Cured Rugged Hides.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Cryptstalker Handguards",lore="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas."},
    [22442]={name="Cryptstalker Girdle",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cryptstalker Girdle'. Starts with Huntsman Leopold in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make a Cryptstalker Girdle if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Girdle, 8 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 3 Nexus Crystals.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Cryptstalker Girdle",lore="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas."},
    [22443]={name="Cryptstalker Wristguards",quality=4,ilvl=88,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Cryptstalker Wristguards'. Starts with Huntsman Leopold in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Huntsman Leopold at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands will make Cryptstalker Wristguards if you bring him the following: 1 Desecrated Wristguards, 6 Wartorn Chain Scraps, 1 Arcanite Bar and 2 Cured Rugged Hides.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Cryptstalker Wristguards",lore="I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas."},
    [22656]={name="The Purifier",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: For 110 Insignias of the Dawn and 110 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn",lore="Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power? I must warn you; purchases made at a friendly reputation with the Dawn come with an extremely hefty surcharge."},
    [22659]={name="Medallion of the Dawn",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: For 110 Insignias of the Dawn and 110 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn",lore="Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power?"},
    [22662]={name="Polar Gloves",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Polar Gloves'. Starts with Craftsman Wilhelm in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 5 Frozen Runes, 12 Enchanted Leather, 3 Essence of Water, 3 Cured Rugged Hides and 200 gold.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Polar Gloves",lore="Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Polar gloves."},
    [22663]={name="Polar Bracers",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Polar Bracers'. Starts with Craftsman Wilhelm in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: Craftsman Wilhelm at Light's Hope Chapel in the Eastern Plaguelands wants 4 Frozen Runes, 12 Enchanted Leather, 3 Essence of Water, 3 Cured Rugged Hides and 200 gold.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Polar Bracers",lore="Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Polar bracers."},
    [22665]={name="Icy Scale Bracers",quality=4,ilvl=80,reqLevel=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Icy Scale Bracers'.",zone="Naxxramas",questName="Icy Scale Bracers",lore="Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Icy Scale bracers."},
    [22668]={name="Bracers of Subterfuge",quality=4,ilvl=60,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: For 110 Insignias of the Dawn and 110 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Epic Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn",lore="Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power? I must warn you; purchases made at a friendly reputation with the Dawn come with an extremely hefty surcharge."},
    [22690]={name="Leggings of the Plague Hunter",quality=3,ilvl=66,sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest 'Superior Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn'. Pick it over the other reward choices. Starts with Quartermaster Miranda Breechlock in Eastern Plaguelands. Objective: For 30 Insignias of the Dawn and 30 Insignias of the Crusade you may choose an item from the Argent Dawn's treasure cache.",zone="Eastern Plaguelands",questName="Superior Armaments of Battle - Friend of the Dawn",lore="Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of power? I must warn you; purchases made at a friendly reputation with the Dawn come with a hefty surcharge."},
